### Test 1: Get Catalog - All
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 2: Get Catalog - By name with geometry
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceName": "Planta",
  "includeGeometry": true
}

### Test 3: Get Catalog - Bounding box
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minLatitude": 14.55,
  "maxLatitude": 14.7,
  "minLongitude": -90.6,
  "maxLongitude": -90.45
}

### Test 4: Get Catalog - Invalid (incomplete bounding box)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minLatitude": 14.55
}
